#. 【戦刃むくろの死体】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[Mukuro's body]"
msgstr ""

#. 戦場むくろの死体って…！
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Mukuro's corpse...?"
msgstr ""

#. 本当に！？　その冷蔵庫の中に、
#. 戦刃むくろの死体が入ってるの！？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Mukuro's body is inside the fridge!?"
msgstr ""

#. 今までのように、私達が学級裁判をしている間に、
#. 運ばれて来たんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just like every other time, the mastermind probably\n"
"brought it up here while we were in the class trial."
msgstr ""

#. …黒幕がやった？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The mastermind did it...?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの学級裁判がまだ続くとは、
#. 思ってもいなかったから…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because they assumed we wouldn't be doing the class\n"
"trial over again, I guess..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…かもしれないわね…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You may be right..."
msgstr ""

#. どっちにしても…
#. これで、ようやく彼女の死体を調べられるわ。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Either way, now I can finally get a good look at the\n"
"body."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そっか、霧切さんは前の捜査の時は、
#. 死体を調べる時間もなかったんだったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, that's right. Kyoko didn't get a chance to check\n"
"the body during the last investigation.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …さっそく今から、
#. 戦刃むくろの死体を調べ直してみるわ。
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I need to do my own examination of the corpse as soon\n"
"as possible."
msgstr ""

#. 今度こそ、この死体から手掛かりを見つけて、
#. 黒幕のしっぽを掴んでみせる…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I'm going to find a clue this time, and I'm going to\n"
"grab the mastermind by the tail..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…ボクはどうしてればいいのかな…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, so...what should *I* do?"
msgstr ""

#. その辺で待ってたら？
#. 後で、捜査結果を教えてあげるわよ。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Why don't you just...wait over there? I'll let you\n"
"know as soon as I'm finished."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その辺…って言われてもな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just...wait over there? That's it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 【説明】
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[Report]"
msgstr ""

#. それで…どんな手掛かりを見つけたの？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So, did you find anything?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体の傷口や出血の跡を
#. じっくりと調べてみたんだけど…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I paid careful attention to the wounds and the traces\n"
"of blood. And it seems highly likely that..."
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、腹部の傷も、後頭部の傷も、
#. <CLT 3>死後に受けた<CLT>可能性が高そうよ…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...the stomach wound and blow to the back of the head\n"
"were inflicted <CLT 3>after death<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体が焼けた影響で、わかりにくくなっていたけど、
#. 間違いないでしょうね。
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The burnt tissue made things a little difficult,\n"
"but I'm completely confident in my findings."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、腹部の傷も後頭部の傷も、
#. 致命傷とは考えられないって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that means neither of those were the fatal injury,\n"
"right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、あの死体の本当の致命傷って…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then what *was* the fatal injury...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>爆破による損傷が激しい為、死体の身元は不明。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"Due to the explosion, the victim's identity\n"
"is unknown.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この爆破は、被害者の死後に行われている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"They were, however, dead before the blast.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腹部のナイフの傷は背中まで達している。
#. このナイフによる刺し傷は、１ヵ所のみ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The victim had been stabbed a single time with a\n"
"knife, which went completely through the body.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>また、後頭部に殴られた形跡もある。
#. 鉄パイプ程度の太さの棒状の物で殴られた様子。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"They had also been struck in the head with an object\n"
"about as thick as a metal pipe.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他にも、全身に数多くの傷跡があるが、
#. ここ数日のものではなく、以前からあった傷のようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The body was covered with other wounds, but these\n"
"were at least several days old.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 残る可能性は<CLT 3>“全身の数多くの傷”<CLT>だけど、
#. それって、古傷だったはずだし…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The only other option is those \"<CLT 3>other wounds<CLT>,\" but\n"
"the file said they were old."
msgstr ""

#. …古傷なんて、どこにも書いてないわよ。
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Where does it say they're old?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. モノクマファイルには、
#. <CLT 3>“ここ数日のものではない傷”<CLT>と書いてあるだけよ。
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All the Monokuma File says is that they were inflicted\n"
"<CLT 3>at least several days ago<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それって、何か違うの…？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I...guess I don't see the difference."
msgstr ""

#. 大いに違うわ。特に言葉の印象がね。
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well the difference is immense, considering the\n"
"impression they give."
msgstr ""

#. あなたは“以前からあった傷”という言葉から、
#. <CLT 3>“古傷”<CLT>という言葉を連想したみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You seem to be equating \"several days old\" with simply\n"
"\"<CLT 3>old<CLT>.\""
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その連想がクセモノだったのよ。
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But that doesn't quite follow logically."
msgstr ""

#. 古傷って言葉から受ける印象…
#. 殺人とは関係ないものに思えるでしょ？
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"\"Old wounds,\" it makes it sound like they've been\n"
"there forever, like they're not related to the murder."
msgstr ""

#. …そうじゃないって事？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you saying...they are?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、ボクらがモノクマファイルを受け取ったのは、
#. 戦刃むくろが殺された直後だったはずだよ？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But we all got the Monokuma File right after she was\n"
"killed, right?"
msgstr ""

#. その時点で、ここ数日の傷じゃないって事は、
#. やっぱり致命傷だとは考えられないんじゃ…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So if the wounds were at least a few days old, there's\n"
"no way they could've had anything to do with it."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろが殺された事自体、
#. ここ数日の事じゃなかったとしたら…？
msgctxt "0040 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But what if Mukuro herself wasn't killed within the\n"
"last few days?"
msgstr ""

#. …え！？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...!?"
msgstr ""

#. 可能性の１つとしては、考えられるはずよ？
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Certainly you can allow it as one of the many\n"
"possibilities, can't you?"
msgstr ""

#. 可能性の１つ…？
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "One of...many?"
msgstr ""

#. 探偵は超能力者じゃないわ。
#. 最初から１つの結論を導き出すなんて事は出来ない。
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"A detective doesn't have supernatural powers. There's\n"
"no way to predict the answer from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#. むしろ、優秀な探偵っていうのは、
#. 最初は多くの可能性を頭の中に描くものよ…
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Instead, the ideal detective begins by imagining as\n"
"many possible scenarios as they can."
msgstr ""

#. 常識や偏見や固定概念に惑わされる事なく、
#. たくさんの可能性を思い描くところから始まり…
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They envision these possibilities without prejudice,\n"
"without bias, using only their logic and common sense."
msgstr ""

#. そして、捜査を重ねる事で、
#. それらの可能性を精査していくのよ。
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Then, as they investigate, they test what they find\n"
"against each of these possibilities."
msgstr ""

#. あなたに探偵の流儀を教えても、
#. 仕方ないかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Of course, me telling you this doesn't mean you'll be\n"
"any good at detective work."
msgstr ""

#. でも、謎の解明を目指す以上は、
#. あなたも覚えておくべきかもね。
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But beyond using that to solve this particular\n"
"mystery, you should keep it in mind for the future."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>霧切の証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Kyoko's Account<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ついでに、<CLT 1>【死体に関して知りたい事】<CLT>があるなら、
#. 今の内に聞いておいた方がいいわよ。
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So, if there's anything else you'd like to know about\n"
"<CLT 1>[the condition of the body]<CLT>, now's the time."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、死体を調べられる機会は、
#. これで最後のはずだから…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We probably won't get another chance to interact with\n"
"it."
msgstr ""

#. 【死体に関して知りたい事】
msgctxt "0053 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[The condition of the body]"
msgstr ""

#. あ、そう言えば、１つだけあるよ。
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Come to think of it, there was one thing..."
msgstr ""

#. さっき、戦刃むくろのプロフィールを見た時、
#. 彼女の身長や体重を見たんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Earlier, when I was looking at Mukuro's profile, it\n"
"listed her height and weight..."
msgstr ""

#. 身長１６９センチ、体重４４キロ。
#. スリーサイズは、８０・５５・８２…でしょ？
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"5 foot 7 inches, 97 pounds. Vitals were...31-22-32.\n"
"Did I get all that right?"
msgstr ""

#. 覚えてるんだ…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You remembered all that...?"
msgstr ""

#. この死体とも、確かに一致していたわよ。
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "They are indeed consistent with the corpse."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…やっぱり…
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So then..."
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルのタトゥーの件もあるし、
#. 間違いないでしょうね。
msgctxt "0060 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And don't forget about the Fenrir tattoo. There's\n"
"absolutely no mistake..."
msgstr ""

#. 死んだのは…戦刃むくろよ…！
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Our victim in this case is, without a doubt, Mukuro\n"
"Ikusaba...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>戦刃むくろのプロフィール<CLT><CLT 23>を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Mukuro Ikusaba's Profile<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …聞きたい事はそれだけ？
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Is that all you wanted to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうだと思う…
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I think so..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、これで…
#. 戦刃むくろの死体にも用はないわね。
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Then it looks like we have no further business with\n"
"Mukuro's body."
msgstr ""

#. …行きましょうか。ここ寒いし。
msgctxt "0066 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Let's get going. It's kind of chilly in here..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、待ってよ…
#. 死体を戻してあげないの？
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, wait, are we not gonna put the body back?"
msgstr ""

#. このまま出しておくのも…
#. 可哀相じゃないかな…
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Don't you think it's kinda...sad, leaving it out like\n"
"this?"
msgstr ""

#. …可哀相？
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Sad...?"
msgstr ""

#. 忘れたの？　彼女も敵の１人なのよ…
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Did you forget? She was our enemy once."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>の１人なのよ…
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "A part of the <CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…殺されたって事は…
#. 結局は被害者な訳だし…
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But she still got killed. She's still a victim..."
msgstr ""

#. …自業自得って言葉は知ってる？
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard the phrase \"you reap what\n"
"you sow\"?"
msgstr ""

#. そうかもしれないけど…
#. でも、やっぱり……
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Well, yeah, but still..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0075 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あなたは本当に甘いのね…
msgctxt "0076 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You really are naive, you know that?"
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…呆れるくらいに……
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's really quite appalling..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、そこでボクを突き放す訳でもなく、
#. 手伝ってくれる霧切さんも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But she could have abandoned me...but she decided to\n"
"help me instead.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女に言わせれば、
#. “甘い”って事なのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So for someone like that, what does it mean to be\n"
"\"naive\"?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、これで…
#. この部屋での捜査はお終いよ。
msgctxt "0080 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I think we've done all we can do here."
msgstr ""

#. ここからは、また別行動ね…
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Back to our separate investigations, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ちょっと待って…！
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ah, hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最後に、もう１つ残っていたはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I still have one more thing to do...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんに聞いておかなきゃいけない事が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something I need to talk to Kyoko about...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカールームで見つけた…
#. あの手帳の件…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to ask her about the pocketbook I found in that\n"
"locker.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かめない訳には…いかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I don't do it now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>再び生物室にやって来たところで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I decided to visit the bio lab one more time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>真っ先に、ボクの視界に飛び込んできたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the first thing I saw when I got there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に倒れている彼女の姿だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...was her, passed out. Again.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　腐川さん…？
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Toko...?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体をしまうのは…
#. 少し待った方がいいみたいよ…
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Maybe we should wait a second before closing it."
msgstr ""

#. …え？　どうして？
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? How come...?"
msgstr ""

#. ここに入っているのが、
#. <CLT 1>【戦刃むくろの死体】<CLT>だからよ…
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because <CLT 1>[Mukuro's body]<CLT> is in here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの集合写真の件…
#. 霧切さんにも聞いておいた方がいいよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should ask Kyoko about that group photo...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、あそこには…
#. 霧切さんも写ってたんだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After all, she's in it too.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、霧切さん…
#. 調べながらでいいから聞いて欲しい事があるんだ…
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Don't let me interrupt your investigation, but I\n"
"wanted to talk to you about something."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0098 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …何？
msgctxt "0099 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. さっきの…モノクマアナウンスの件なんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's about that announcement Monokuma made earlier..."
msgstr ""

#. …ヒントがどうのってヤツなら、
#. 行ってないわよ…
msgctxt "0101 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You mean the one about a \"hint\" or something? I didn't\n"
"take him up on the offer."
msgstr ""

#. え？　どうして？
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Why not?"
msgstr ""

#. このタイミングでヒントなんて、
#. 私達を惑わそうとしてるに決まってじゃない。
msgctxt "0103 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The only reason he'd give us a \"hint\" at this point\n"
"would be to confuse us, to cloud our judgment."
msgstr ""

#. それに、ヒントなんかなくたって、
#. 自力で謎を解いてみせる…
msgctxt "0104 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I can solve this mystery on my own, without whatever\n"
"hints he may have to offer."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…そうだよね…
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's...a good point."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの意見も聞いておきたかったけど、
#. 仕方がないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wish I could go back and do the same thing,\n"
"but what's done is done, I guess...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、この霧切さんの様子からして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Standing here looking at her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とてもボクを騙そうとしているようには、
#. 思えないし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I don't think she's hiding anything from me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、やっぱり、あの写真は、
#. ボクらを惑わす為に黒幕が用意した“罠”…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is she right? Did the mastermind forge that picture as\n"
"a trap to confuse us?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだよな…
#. そうでないと説明付かないもんな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's gotta be it. There's no other explanation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、終わったわよ…
msgctxt "0111 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Okay, Makoto. I'm done."
msgstr ""

#. もう調べ終わったの！？　早かったね！
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Already? Jeez, that was fast!"
msgstr ""

#. 遅い仕事なら誰にでも出来るわ。
#. だから、<CLT 1>【説明】<CLT>も手短に終わらせるわよ…
msgctxt "0113 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyone can do good work if they go slow. In that\n"
"spirit, I'll make my <CLT 1>[report]<CLT> brief."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、終わったわよ…
msgctxt "0114 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Okay, Makoto. I'm done."
msgstr ""

#. もう調べ終わったの！？　早かったね！
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Already? Jeez, that was fast!"
msgstr ""

#. 遅い仕事なら誰にでも出来るわ。
#. だから、<CLT 1>【説明】<CLT>も手短に終わらせるわよ…
msgctxt "0116 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyone can do good work if they go slow. In that\n"
"spirit, I'll make my <CLT 1>[report]<CLT> brief."
msgstr ""

#. ついでに、<CLT 1>【死体に関して知りたい事】<CLT>があるなら、
#. 今の内に聞いておいた方がいいわよ。
msgctxt "0117 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So, if there's anything else you'd like to know about\n"
"<CLT 1>[the condition of the body]<CLT>, now's the time."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、死体を調べられる機会は、
#. これで最後のはずだから…
msgctxt "0118 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We probably won't get another chance to interact with\n"
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、霧切さん…
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. 最後に１つだけ…
#. どうしても聞いておきたい事があるんだ。
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I did have one last thing... I know I shouldn't, but I\n"
"feel like I have to ask..."
msgstr ""

#. …何かしら？　言ってみて。
msgctxt "0121 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Go ahead, then. Out with it."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…この学園に来てから、
#. １度もお父さんと会ってないの…？
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Have you really not seen your dad even once since you\n"
"got here?"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0123 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. …どういう意味？
msgctxt "0124 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 寄宿舎の２階に、
#. ロッカールームがあったのは知ってるよね？
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...you know all those lockers on the 2nd floor of\n"
"the dorms?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ、知ってるわ…
msgctxt "0126 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I do, yes."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、あそこのロッカーは、
#. 本人の電子生徒手帳でしか開けられないはずよ？
msgctxt "0127 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But to get into any of the lockers, you'd need the\n"
"handbook of whoever the locker belongs to."
msgstr ""

#. 緊急用の電子生徒手帳を使ったんだよ…
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Actually...I managed to get them open using that\n"
"emergency handbook."
msgstr ""

#. 学園長の部屋にあった電子生徒手帳ね…
msgctxt "0129 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The one you found in the headmaster's hidden room..."
msgstr ""

#. …それで、そのロッカーで、
#. どんな手掛かりを見つけたの？
msgctxt "0130 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So? Did you find anything worthwhile in the lockers?"
msgstr ""

#. 手帳だよ…
#. しかも、その手帳はボクが見た限りだと…
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I found...a pocketbook. And after looking through\n"
"it..."
msgstr ""

#. …霧切さんの物としか思えなかった。
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...I think it must be *your* pocketbook."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0133 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. なんで…そんな風に思うの…？
msgctxt "0134 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What makes you say that...?"
msgstr ""

#. さっきも言った通り、
#. あのロッカーは本人にしか開けられないはずよ？
msgctxt "0135 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Like I said, only the locker's owner should be able to\n"
"get into it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そして、あそこにあったのは、
#. 私達に割り当てられたロッカーとは考えられない。
msgctxt "0136 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I can't imagine those lockers belonged to any of us..."
msgstr ""

#. 私達が、あそこに入れるようになったのは、
#. つい最近の事だからね。
msgctxt "0137 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"After all, we only got access to that area just\n"
"recently."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、私があのロッカーを使えたはずないのよ。
msgctxt "0138 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What I'm saying is, there's no way I could've had\n"
"access to any of those lockers."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、どうして、
#. 私がロッカーに手帳を入れる必要があるの？
msgctxt "0139 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And if I *did* have a pocketbook, why would I bother\n"
"putting it in a locker?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、そうかもしれないけど…
#. でも、その手帳に書いてあったんだよ。
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Everything you just said makes perfect sense. But\n"
"there was something written inside..."
msgstr ""

#. 学園長の事を…お父さんって…
msgctxt "0141 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was about the headmaster—about your father."
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！？
msgctxt "0142 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...!?"
msgstr "...!?"

#. もしか…して…
msgctxt "0143 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Could that mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. だとすると…あの映像も…？
#. 本物…って事…？
msgctxt "0144 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That video...is real, too...?"
msgstr ""

#. あの映像…？
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Video?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君…どうやら、
#. すべてが繋がってきたみたいよ…
msgctxt "0146 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto...I think everything is finally starting to fit\n"
"together to reveal a cohesive picture."
msgstr ""

#. 最悪の繋がり方…だけどね。
msgctxt "0147 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Although...I'm afraid that picture might be worse than\n"
"anything we could have imagined."
msgstr ""

#. …ど、どういう意味？
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、これからロッカールームに行ってみるわ。
msgctxt "0149 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I need to go investigate those lockers, right now."
msgstr ""

#. あなたが言った事を
#. 直接、自分の目で確かめたいの。
msgctxt "0150 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I need to confirm what you just said with my own two\n"
"eyes."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、学園長の電子生徒手帳を渡しておくよ。
#. これがあれば…
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, let me give you the headmaster's handbook. That\n"
"way you can—"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、必要ないわ。
msgctxt "0152 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That won't be necessary."
msgstr ""

#. 私の考え通りなら、
#. そのロッカーは私の生徒手帳で開くはず。
msgctxt "0153 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If I'm right about this, I shouldn't have any problem\n"
"opening the locker with my own handbook."
msgstr ""

#. だって、それは
#. 間違いなく<CLT 3>“私のロッカー”<CLT>なんだから…
msgctxt "0154 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "After all, it would seem that it's <CLT 3>my locker<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんのロッカー…？
msgctxt "0155 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Your locker...?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたも…これを見てみればわかるわ…
msgctxt "0156 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you watch this, it'll all make sense."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、ＤＶＤ…？
#. しかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0157 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A DVD...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>第７８期生…緊急面談…って！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And it says...\"Class #78: Urgent Interviews\"!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あなたがいなくなった後で、
#. あの隠し部屋から見つけたの…
msgctxt "0159 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I found it in that hidden room, after you left."
msgstr ""

#. 私の考えを詳しく説明している時間はないから、
#. 代わりにを見ておいて。
msgctxt "0160 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to explain exactly what I think it\n"
"means, so just watch it and see for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. そうすれば、あなたも、
#. その意味に気付くはずよ…
msgctxt "0161 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I think you'll realize exactly what it means..."
msgstr ""

#. 私の知らないところで…
#. 私の手帳がロッカーに入れられていた意味が…
msgctxt "0162 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You'll understand why you found my pocketbook in a\n"
"place none of us have ever seen before."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…よくわからないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0163 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>None of this makes sense right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…とりあえず、このＤＶＤに、
#. 重要な手掛かりがあるって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0164 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I guess that means there's some important clue on\n"
"this DVD...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>緊急面談のＤＶＤ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0165 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Interview DVD<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それと、最後にもう１つだけ…
msgctxt "0166 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Oh, and now it's my turn."
msgstr ""

#. 少しだけ、私の無駄話に付き合ってくれる…？
msgctxt "0167 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do you have a second to listen to me ramble...?"
msgstr ""

#. …無駄話？
msgctxt "0168 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ramble...?"
msgstr ""

#. 結論から言うと…
msgctxt "0169 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So as it turns out..."
msgstr ""

#. 整理は…付かなかった。
msgctxt "0170 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...the arrangements I'd made...didn't stick."
msgstr ""

#. むしろ、ますますわからなくなったわ…
#. 自分の気持ちさえもね…
msgctxt "0171 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What I mean is, I'm less and less sure of everything.\n"
"Even my own feelings..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、お父さんの事…だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0172 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You're talking about your dad, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. その答えが見つかる事はもうないでしょうね…
#. この先、永遠に…
msgctxt "0173 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I can never find the answers to the questions I wanted\n"
"to ask. For the rest of my life..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕…あいつのせいで……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0174 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And all because of the mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、１つだけハッキリしている事があるわ…
msgctxt "0175 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But there's one thing I *am* sure of."
msgstr ""

#. 私の…黒幕を許せないって気持ち…
msgctxt "0176 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When it comes to the mastermind, there's no room in my\n"
"heart for forgiveness."
msgstr ""

#. 私は、絶対に黒幕に勝ちたい。
#. その理由が１つ増えたわ。
msgctxt "0177 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I swore to destroy the mastermind. This is just one\n"
"more reason to follow through on that."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの目には、
#. 強い意思の炎が宿っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0178 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko's eyes burned with the fire of determination...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕に勝ちたいという強い意志が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0179 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The determination to defeat the mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 不思議ね…あの人の死を知って、
#. こんな気持ちになるなんて…
msgctxt "0180 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's strange...to be confronted with his death, and\n"
"suddenly feel this way."
msgstr ""

#. もし、あの人が幸せになっていたとしたら、
#. きっと、私はなんとも思わなかったはず…
msgctxt "0181 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I couldn't care less if my father had found happiness."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに…なぜかしら？
msgctxt "0182 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So why is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. あの人の不幸が…
#. こんなに…許せないなんて…
msgctxt "0183 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Why does it bother me so much to know how he\n"
"suffered...?"
msgstr ""

#. バカバカしくて…
#. 自分でも…よくわからないわ…
msgctxt "0184 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's ridiculous. There's just no understanding it, I\n"
"guess..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、彼女は小さく笑った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She let out a small laugh as she said it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とても悲しげな笑顔で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0186 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But her smile was filled with sorrow.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さてと…無駄話はこのくらいにしましょうか。
msgctxt "0187 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So, that's it for my rambling."
msgstr ""

#. 目的を果たす為にも、
#. まだ、やらなければいけない事が残ってるわ。
msgctxt "0188 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There's still much to do before I can consider my task\n"
"complete."
msgstr ""

#. うん、そうだね…
msgctxt "0189 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, you're right."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、これだけは覚えておいて…
msgctxt "0190 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But keep this in mind..."
msgstr ""

#. 真実はいつも１つよ…
msgctxt "0191 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "There is only ever one absolute truth."
msgstr ""

#. それが、<CLT 3>“正義”<CLT>であろうと、
#. <CLT 3>“悪”<CLT>であろうと…
msgctxt "0192 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Whether that truth serves <CLT 3>justice<CLT> or <CLT 3>suffering<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“最善”<CLT>であろうと、
#. <CLT 3>“最悪”<CLT>であろうともね…
msgctxt "0193 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Whether it's the <CLT 3>greatest<CLT> truth, or the <CLT 3>worst<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. …どういう意味？
msgctxt "0194 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What do you mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. たどり着いた真相が絶望的なものだとしても、
#. それでも…
msgctxt "0195 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Even if the truth you uncover is filled with\n"
"hopelessness..."
msgstr ""

#. 希望だけは失わないでね…
msgctxt "0196 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...you still can't give up hope."
msgstr ""

#. あ、当たり前だよ…
#. だって…！
msgctxt "0197 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Absolutely not! Because..."
msgstr ""

#. 前向きなのだけが…
#. ボクの唯一の取り柄なんだよ？
msgctxt "0198 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because all I can do is keep moving forward. That's\n"
"pretty much all I'm good at, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. そう…だったわね…
msgctxt "0199 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Indeed..."
msgstr ""

#. 変な事言ってごめんなさい…
msgctxt "0200 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Sorry if that was...strange."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、私は先に行くわね…
msgctxt "0201 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Anyway, I need to get going."
msgstr ""

#. また後で…最後の学級裁判で会いましょう。
msgctxt "0202 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'll see you at the class trial..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな別れの挨拶を残して、
#. 霧切さんは、生物室を後にした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0203 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leaving behind that final farewell, Kyoko was gone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さてと…ボクも行かないとな…
msgctxt "0204 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better get going myself."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんから預かったＤＶＤ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I got that DVD from Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>視聴覚室に行けば、
#. 中の映像を確認出来るはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should head to the A/V room to check it out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、絶望的な真相とか言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0207 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said something about hopeless truth...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、何があろうとボクは諦めない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0208 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But no matter what happens, I *won't* lose hope.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最悪の真相だろうとなんだろうと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0209 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if it's the worst truth in the world...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>絶対に負けてたまるか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I can't afford to lose!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0211 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time for this!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0212 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time for this!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか開いてる！！
#. けど、腐川さんが先だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0213 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's open! Oh, but Toko...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>冷蔵庫が…開いてる…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0214 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The fridge—it's open!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、前に来た時は…
#. ちゃんと全部閉じてたはずなのに…
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I'm sure they were all shut tight last time I was\n"
"here..."
msgstr ""

#. それのせいだったのね…
msgctxt "0216 | NO NAME"
msgid "That must be why she passed out."
msgstr ""

#. 腐川さんが気を失った理由って…
msgctxt "0217 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "She faints so easily..."
msgstr ""

#. …き、霧切さん！
msgctxt "0218 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko!"
msgstr ""

#. 遅くなったわね…
msgctxt "0219 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's getting late, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. もう…平気なの？
msgctxt "0220 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you...okay?"
msgstr ""

#. 悪かったわね…心配かけて…
msgctxt "0221 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm sorry if I made you worry."
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…謝られるような事じゃ…
msgctxt "0222 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, you don't have to apologize."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、苗木君。
#. それより、この部屋って…
msgctxt "0223 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But listen, about this room..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それが…
msgctxt "0224 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh yeah, it's..."
msgstr ""

#. 死体安置所…のようね…
msgctxt "0225 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's a morgue."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうなんだ。
msgctxt "0226 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、そうだったのね…
msgctxt "0227 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I suspected as much."
msgstr ""

#. そして、腐川さんは、
#. その冷蔵庫の中を見たせいで気を失った…
msgctxt "0228 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And Toko must have looked inside the fridge, seen what\n"
"was in there, and...well, there you have it."
msgstr ""

#. 知ってたの？　腐川さんが気を失った事…
msgctxt "0229 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You knew she'd fainted?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょうど今…
#. 走っていくジェノサイダーとすれ違ったわ。
msgctxt "0230 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I was on my way here, when Genocide Jack came running\n"
"past me."
msgstr ""

#. クシャミでもしたのかと思ったけど、
#. この部屋を見て、本当の理由がわかった…
msgctxt "0231 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I assumed she must have sneezed, but once I got\n"
"inside, the real reason became clear."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女はこの部屋について調べようとして、
#. そこで、冷蔵庫を開けてしまったんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0232 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I imagine she came here to investigate, and when she\n"
"opened the slot there..."
msgstr ""

#. それで…中の死体を見て、
#. 気を失っちゃったのか…
msgctxt "0233 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's when she saw the body inside and dropped like a\n"
"bag of rocks..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…って、人騒がせだな。本当に。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0234 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why's everything gotta be so difficult with her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず、冷蔵庫を元に戻しましょうか。
#. 開いたままにしておく訳にもいかないでしょう…
msgctxt "0235 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, we should close it up. Don't want to leave it\n"
"hanging open like that..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうだね…
msgctxt "0236 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, good idea."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君。手伝って…
msgctxt "0237 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Give me a hand with this."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは冷蔵庫に近付くと、
#. そこに手を掛け…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0238 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko approached the fridge, hands outstretched.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…そして止まった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0239 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But suddenly...she stopped.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どうしたの？
msgctxt "0240 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体をしまうのは…
#. 少し待った方がいいみたい…
msgctxt "0241 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Maybe we should wait a second before closing it."
msgstr ""

#. …え？　どうして？
msgctxt "0242 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? How come...?"
msgstr ""

#. ここに入っているのが、
#. <CLT 1>【戦刃むくろの死体】<CLT>だからよ…
msgctxt "0243 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because <CLT 1>[Mukuro's body]<CLT> is in here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0244 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体を入れておく為の冷蔵庫…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0245 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a fridge meant for storing dead bodies...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0246 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>ボクじゃあ、勇気がなくて…
#. 中は見られないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0247 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't do it...! I can't look inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが先だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0248 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to deal with Toko...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これも気になるけど、
#. でも、今は先に……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0249 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This seems important, but first...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちの左半分の冷蔵庫には、
#. 青いランプが点灯している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0250 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the left side of the refrigerator, a bunch of blue\n"
"lights are on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、こっちにはランプが付いてない…
msgctxt "0251 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But these ones aren't..."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、使用中の冷蔵庫には
#. ランプが点灯するようになっているのね…
msgctxt "0252 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It would seem the blue light comes on when a slot\n"
"is occupied."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>使用中の冷蔵庫には…
#. ランプが点灯…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0253 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So when someone's in there...the blue light comes\n"
"on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、点灯しているランプは、
#. 戦刃むくろの死体が入れられてる冷蔵庫も含めて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0254 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking around, the number of lights that are on,\n"
"including Mukuro's...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>全部で９個だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0255 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nine in all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ９個……
msgctxt "0256 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nine..."
msgstr ""

#. ９個の…ランプ…？
msgctxt "0257 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nine lights...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>生物室のランプ<CLT><CLT 23>を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0258 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bio Lab Lights<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、終わったわよ…
msgctxt "0259 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Okay, Makoto. I'm done."
msgstr ""

#. もう調べ終わったの！？　早かったね！
msgctxt "0260 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Already? Jeez, that was fast!"
msgstr ""

#. 遅い仕事なら誰にでも出来るわ。
#. だから、<CLT 1>【説明】<CLT>も手短に終わらせるわよ…
msgctxt "0261 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyone can do good work if they go slow. In that\n"
"spirit, I'll make my <CLT 1>[report]<CLT> brief."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちの左半分の冷蔵庫には、
#. 青いランプが点灯している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0262 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the left side of the refrigerator, a bunch of blue\n"
"lights are on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、使用中の冷蔵庫には
#. ランプが点灯するようになってるんだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0263 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like the blue light comes on when there's\n"
"someone in that slot.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、点灯しているランプは、
#. 戦刃むくろの死体が入れられてる冷蔵庫も含めて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0264 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking around, the number of lights that are on,\n"
"including Mukuro's...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>全部で９個だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0265 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nine in all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ９個…
msgctxt "0266 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nine..."
msgstr ""

#. ９個の…ランプ…？
msgctxt "0267 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nine lights...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが先だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0268 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to deal with Toko...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この取扱説明書はもう見た。
#. それよりも、今は……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0269 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've already looked through this instruction manual.\n"
"More importantly...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが先だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0270 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now I need to deal with Toko...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これも気になるけど、
#. でも、今は先に……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0271 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking at this, I can't help but notice...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば、このビニールシートって、
#. どこかで見覚えがあると思ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0272 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You know, I think I've seen a tarp like this somewhere\n"
"before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>植物庭園の物置にあった、
#. あのビニールシートと一緒なんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0273 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Ah, it's the same as the one I found in the garden\n"
"toolshed...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、あのビニールシートには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0274 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And if I remember, that tarp...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“生物室”<CLT><CLT 4>ってスタンプも
#. 押してあったはずだ。<CLT>
msgctxt "0275 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 4>It had a stamp on it that said <CLT><CLT 3>bio lab<CLT><CLT 4>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、植物庭園で偽装工作に使われた、
#. あのビニールシートって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0276 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that's the tarp that was used to help camouflage\n"
"the murder in the garden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…間違いない。
#. この生物室にあった物だったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0277 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>At some point, someone got it from the bio lab and\n"
"took it over there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ビニールシート<CLT><CLT 23>を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0278 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Tarp<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the Truth Bullets section\n"
"of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、終わったわよ…
msgctxt "0279 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Okay, Makoto. I'm done."
msgstr ""

#. もう調べ終わったの！？　早かったね！
msgctxt "0280 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Already? Jeez, that was fast!"
msgstr ""

#. 遅い仕事なら誰にでも出来るわ。
#. だから、<CLT 1>【説明】<CLT>も手短に終わらせるわよ…
msgctxt "0281 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyone can do good work if they go slow. In that\n"
"spirit, I'll make my <CLT 1>[report]<CLT> brief."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これも気になるけど、
#. でも、今は先に……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0282 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looking at this, I can't help but notice...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ふ、腐川さん！　大丈夫！？
msgctxt "0283 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "T-Toko! Are you okay!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ま、まさか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0284 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No... No!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死んでるとか…ないよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0285 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's not...dead, is she!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラ！
msgctxt "0286 | GENOCIDER SHOU"
msgid "Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. うわッ！
msgctxt "0287 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Uwah!"
msgstr ""

#. 寒い…！　異常に寒いし！！
#. 風邪引きそう！！
msgctxt "0288 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's cold... It's super cold! It's so cold, I think I\n"
"might catch cold!"
msgstr ""

#. …そりゃ、引くよ。
#. こんな所で寝てたらさ…
msgctxt "0289 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you keep taking naps in places like this, I'm sure\n"
"you will..."
msgstr ""

#. …寝てた？
#. あぁ、アタシったらまた気を失ってたのね！
msgctxt "0290 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What, I was asleep? Ahh, I musta fainted again!"
msgstr ""

#. そんで、あんたはアタシの寝てる姿を眺めて、
#. ムラムラしてたのねッ！！
msgctxt "0291 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I bet you were standing there, staring at me, getting\n"
"all excited! Weren't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…してないけど…
msgctxt "0292 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...I wasn't..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ何！？　ムンムン？　ルンルン！？
msgctxt "0293 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Oh, then what? Hot and bothered? Straight-up horny!?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それよりさ…
#. どうして、気を失ってたの？
msgctxt "0294 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, okay, so...why did you pass out?"
msgstr ""

#. シラネ！　気付いたら寝てた！！
#. また、あっちの根暗が何かやらかしたんじゃね！？
msgctxt "0295 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I dunno! Last thing I remember was me waking up just\n"
"now! What'd you do to Miss Morose!?"
msgstr ""

#. そっか…人格が変わっちゃうと、
#. 記憶を引き継げないんだったね…
msgctxt "0296 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's right. Your memory stops and starts each\n"
"time you switch..."
msgstr ""

#. そう！　知識は共有してても、
#. 記憶は共有していないの！
msgctxt "0297 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Bingo bazinga! We share some basic knowledge, but our\n"
"memories are very much separate!"
msgstr ""

#. …って、欠点みたいな言い方すんな！！
#. むしろ長所じゃねーか！！
msgctxt "0298 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"And don't say it like it's a bad thing! It's a\n"
"blessing as far as I'm concerned!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、あっちの人格が覚えてない事でも、
#. アタシは覚えていられるのよ！
msgctxt "0299 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Cuz even if *she* forgets something, I totally\n"
"remember!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、２倍なのよ！！
msgctxt "0300 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So it's like double the memory!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、２分の１って感じだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0301 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Uh, no...it's more like half.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ジェノサイダーの秘密<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0302 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Genocide Jack's Memory<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より、ダーリンは！？
#. 教えなきゃ、殺すぞ！！
msgctxt "0303 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But all I wanna know right now is, where's my little\n"
"darling!? Tell me now, or I slit your throat!"
msgstr ""

#. と、十神クンも…
#. どこかを捜査してるはずだけど…
msgctxt "0304 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I-I don't know. I'm sure Byakuya's around somewhere,\n"
"doing his own investigating."
msgstr ""

#. １人で！？
msgctxt "0305 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "By himself!?"
msgstr ""

#. …だと思うけど。
msgctxt "0306 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I assume so..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱりね！　わかってたけどね！
#. アタシって白夜様に関してはプロだから！！
msgctxt "0307 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I knew it! I totally knew it! I'm a total pro when it\n"
"comes to all things Master!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、急がねーと！！
#. 白夜様が１人で寂しいわ！
msgctxt "0308 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I gotta hurry! I can't even imagine how lonely\n"
"he must be right now!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0309 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeeeehahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この上なく不気味な笑い声を上げながら、
#. 腐川さんは走り去っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0310 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko shot off, her eerie laughter echoing behind her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば…
#. 写真の事を聞きそびれたけど…
msgctxt "0311 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ah, I totally forgot to ask her about the picture..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ジェノサイダーに聞くだけ無駄か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0312 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, there's no point asking Genocide Jack anyway.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、今は、
#. 他に確認すべき事があるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0313 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Besides, I have more important things to do right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが気絶した理由…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0314 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why did Toko faint?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女が気絶したって事は、
#. そこに、なんらかの理由があるはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0315 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's gotta be some reason for it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ…出ていく訳にはいかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0316 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't leave with things the way they are right\n"
"now...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0317 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0318 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0319 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
